"\n\nWhat happened: %@." = "\n\n发生了什么：%@。";
"\"%@\" already exists in your library. Replacing it can't be undone." = "“%@”已在你的游戏库中。替换后无法还原。";
"\"%@\" doesn't say. Desktop Cemu's are named ..._vkpipeline.bin and MuffinEMU's ..._mtlpipeline.bin. It's stored under the matching name either way." = "“%@”未注明。桌面版 Cemu 的文件名为 ..._vkpipeline.bin，MuffinEMU 的为 ..._mtlpipeline.bin。无论哪种，都会以匹配的名称存储。";
"\"%@\" is a cache for %@, but none of its %d entries can be used." = "“%@”是 %@ 的缓存，但其中 %d 个条目都无法使用。";
