"\"%@\" is a cache for another game (title ID %@), not %@. Nothing was imported." = "“%@”是另一款游戏（标题 ID %@）的缓存，不是 %@ 的。未导入任何内容。";
"\"%@\" is a learned-shader cache from a desktop Cemu older than 1.16, which keyed shaders differently. It can't be converted. Use a cache from Cemu 1.16 or newer, or from MuffinEMU." = "“%@”是旧于 1.16 的桌面版 Cemu 的已学习着色器缓存，其着色器键值方式不同，无法转换。请使用 Cemu 1.16 或更高版本、或 MuffinEMU 的缓存。";
"\"%@\" is a learned-shader cache, not a pipeline cache. Use \"Import learned shaders\" for it." = "“%@”是已学习着色器缓存，不是管线缓存。请使用“导入已学习的着色器”。";
"\"%@\" is a pipeline cache, not learned shaders. Use \"Import shader pipeline caches\" for it." = "“%@”是管线缓存，不是已学习的着色器。请使用“导入着色器管线缓存”。";
"\"%@\" is only linked, so its file stays where it is and isn't deleted. Your saves and options are kept. You can bring it back from Settings > Library." = "“%@”仅为链接，其文件保留在原位置，不会被删除。你的存档和选项会保留。你可以在“设置”>“游戏库”中将其恢复。";
"\"%@\" is stored on a drive or folder MuffinEMU can't reach right now. Connect the drive, then try again." = "“%@”存放在 MuffinEMU 目前无法访问的驱动器或文件夹中。请连接驱动器，然后重试。";
