"\"%@\" isn't a Wii U game file MuffinEMU can read. It accepts .wua, .wux, .wud, .iso, .rpx, .elf and .wuhb files." = "“%@”不是 MuffinEMU 可读取的 Wii U 游戏文件。支持 .wua、.wux、.wud、.iso、.rpx、.elf 和 .wuhb 文件。";
"\"%@\" isn't a shader cache file, or it's damaged. Pick a .bin file from a Cemu or MuffinEMU shaderCache folder." = "“%@”不是着色器缓存文件，或已损坏。请从 Cemu 或 MuffinEMU 的 shaderCache 文件夹中选取 .bin 文件。";
