"A custom server is a community-run replacement for Nintendo's Wii U online services. Whoever runs it gives you a network_services.xml file, or the addresses to enter here.\n\nThe active server is saved to Documents/mlc/network_services.xml.\n\nCustom doesn't need a linked account or otp.bin and seeprom.bin: the server decides what it needs. Pretendo does need them." = "自定义服务器是社区运营的、用来替代任天堂 Wii U 在线服务的服务器。运营者会给你一个 network_services.xml 文件，或让你在此输入的地址。\n\n活跃的服务器会保存到 Documents/mlc/network_services.xml。\n\n自定义不需要已链接的账户，也不需要 otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin：由服务器决定需要什么。Pretendo 则需要它们。";
