"A self-hosted server for Monster Hunter 3 Ultimate, built to stand in for Nintendo's Wii U online servers. It doesn't need a Wii U or a console dump. Someone runs the host on a computer and gives you a network_services.xml, which you import above." = "一个自行托管的《怪物猎人 3 Ultimate》服务器，用来替代任天堂的 Wii U 在线服务器。它不需要 Wii U 或主机转储。由某人在电脑上运行主机，并给你一个 network_services.xml，你可在上方导入它。";
"A shader cache is what a game has saved so the next start skips building its shaders again. Size on disk is everything saved for this game, and Last updated is the last time any of it changed.\n\nClear this game's shaders lets you remove just the compiled ones (one slow start, nothing else lost) or everything including the learned ones (the game stutters while it relearns them).\n\nAdvanced mode also shows how many shaders and pipelines are saved for the renderer you've selected, splits the size into learned and compiled, and can export this game's Metal shader files to Files, for backing up or moving to another device. The counts are hidden while a game is running. The settings under Settings > Shaders cover every game at once." = "着色器缓存是游戏保存下来的内容，让下次启动时无需再次构建着色器。“磁盘占用大小”是为此游戏保存的全部内容，“上次更新”是其中任何内容最近一次发生变化的时间。\n\n“清除此游戏的着色器”可让你只移除已编译的着色器（只会有一次较慢的启动，其他内容不会丢失），或移除包括已学习着色器在内的全部内容（游戏在重新学习期间会卡顿）。\n\n“高级”模式还会显示你所选渲染器已保存的着色器和管线数量，将大小拆分为已学习和已编译两部分，并可将此游戏的 Metal 着色器文件导出到“文件”，用于备份或移到另一台设备。游戏运行期间会隐藏这些数量。“设置”>“着色器”下的设置适用于所有游戏。";
