"Art packs are community collections of cover art, most of them 3D boxes. Download one and MuffinEMU matches its images to your games by title and region.\n\nThe download needs free space for the file and for the unpacked images at the same time; MuffinEMU checks first and says if there isn't enough. Keep MuffinEMU open while a pack downloads. Cancel stops it and cleans up.\n\nPacks are stored where Files can't see them, and aren't included in device backups, since they can be downloaded again." = "封面包是社区整理的封面图集合，大多为 3D 盒装封面。下载一个后，MuffinEMU 会按标题和地区将其图像匹配到你的游戏。\n\n下载时需要同时有足够的可用空间存放文件和解压后的图像；MuffinEMU 会先检查，空间不足时会告知你。封面包下载期间请保持 MuffinEMU 打开。点按“取消”会停止下载并清理。\n\n封面包存放在“文件”看不到的位置，且不包含在设备备份中，因为可以重新下载。";
