"Basic" = "基础";
"Basic hides the advanced settings and runs them at their defaults until you switch back." = "“基础”会隐藏高级设置，并以默认值运行它们，直到你切换回来。";
"Basic keeps Settings short. The advanced settings run at their defaults and their rows are hidden.\n\nAdvanced shows all of them: the renderer, scaling filters, gamma, Steady frame rate, CPU cores, when cooling down starts, the emulated clock, overlay details, stick feel, audio channels, diagnostics, and a game's own CPU cores, filters and Steady frame rate. The performance profile, motion aiming, library grouping and settings backups are in both.\n\nWhen you switch to Basic, MuffinEMU sets your advanced settings, and each game's, aside and uses the defaults. Switching back to Advanced puts them all back as they were.\n\nReset settings to defaults (under About) also puts this back to Basic and forgets the saved values." = "“基础”让“设置”保持简短。高级设置以默认值运行，其行会被隐藏。\n\n“高级”会显示全部设置：渲染器、缩放滤镜、伽马、稳定帧率、CPU 核心、降温开始时机、模拟时钟、叠加层详情、摇杆手感、音频声道、诊断，以及游戏自己的 CPU 核心、滤镜和稳定帧率。性能配置、体感瞄准、游戏库分组和设置备份在两种模式下都有。\n\n切换到“基础”时，MuffinEMU 会将你的高级设置以及每款游戏的高级设置搁置起来，改用默认值。切换回“高级”会将它们全部恢复原样。\n\n“将设置重置为默认值”（在“关于”下）也会将此项恢复为“基础”，并清除已保存的值。";
