"Compile shaders in the background builds shaders while the game keeps running. Most games want this on; Nano Assault Neo breaks with it, so it can be set per game.\n\nPerformance profile picks the trade-off for this game: Speed, Accuracy (slower but more accurate, on one CPU core; can fix a game that glitches or crashes) or Battery saver (one CPU core).\n\nResolution changes how large the picture is drawn for this game.\n\nSwitch Settings mode to Advanced on Settings > General to set CPU cores, the scaling filters and Steady frame rate for this game too." = "“在后台编译着色器”会在游戏继续运行的同时构建着色器。大多数游戏适合开启；Nano Assault Neo 开启后会出问题，因此可以按游戏单独设置。\n\n“性能配置”为此游戏选择取舍：速度、精度（较慢但更准确，使用一个 CPU 核心；可修复出现画面错误或崩溃的游戏）或省电（一个 CPU 核心）。\n\n“分辨率”改变此游戏的画面绘制大小。\n\n在“设置”>“通用”中将“设置模式”切换为“高级”，还可为此游戏设置 CPU 核心、缩放滤镜和稳定帧率。";
"Compile shaders in the background builds shaders while the game keeps running. Most games want this on; Nano Assault Neo breaks with it.\n\nPerformance profile picks the trade-off for this game: Speed, Accuracy (slower but more accurate, on one CPU core; can fix a game that glitches or crashes) or Battery saver (one CPU core).\n\nResolution and the two scaling filters change how the picture is drawn for this game.\n\nCPU cores picks how many cores run the game. Auto decides for each game and device." = "“在后台编译着色器”会在游戏继续运行的同时构建着色器。大多数游戏适合开启；Nano Assault Neo 开启后会出问题。\n\n“性能配置”为此游戏选择取舍：速度、精度（较慢但更准确，使用一个 CPU 核心；可修复出现画面错误或崩溃的游戏）或省电（一个 CPU 核心）。\n\n“分辨率”和两个缩放滤镜会改变此游戏的画面绘制方式。\n\n“CPU 核心”选择运行游戏的核心数量。“自动”会针对每款游戏和每台设备自行决定。";
