"Display gamma adjusts how bright the mid-tones look without changing pure black or pure white. 2.2 is the standard display gamma and the default; lower looks flatter and brighter in the mids, higher looks more contrasty and darker in the mids. Takes effect on the next frame." = "显示伽马调整中间调看起来的亮度，不改变纯黑或纯白。2.2 是标准显示伽马，也是默认值；较低时中间调更平、更亮，较高时对比度更强、中间调更暗。在下一帧生效。";
