"Drag a button along its arc, or in and out. Presses do nothing while you do." = "沿弧线或向内外拖移按键。拖移时按键不会有任何响应。";
"Drag a button to move it. Positions are saved for this game only; the size applies to every game." = "拖移按键即可移动。位置仅为此游戏保存；大小适用于所有游戏。";
"Drag a group of buttons to move it, or pinch it to resize it. Nothing here reaches the game." = "拖移一组按键即可移动，或捏合缩放。此处的内容不会传到游戏中。";
"Drag any button to move it on its own, or pinch it to resize. L and ZL move together, and so do R and ZR. Nothing here reaches the game." = "拖移任意按键可单独移动它，或捏合缩放。L 和 ZL 一起移动，R 和 ZR 也是。此处的内容不会传到游戏中。";
"Drag the circle. The grey dot is where your thumb is; the blue dot is what the game is sent, after everything below and your calibration. Nothing here reaches the game." = "拖移圆圈。灰点是你拇指的位置；蓝点是经过下方所有设置和你的校准后发送给游戏的内容。此处的内容不会传到游戏中。";
"Drag the empty space inside a dashed box to move that whole half - L/ZL and the rest of the left side together, R/ZR and the right side together. Nothing here reaches the game." = "拖移虚线框内的空白区域即可移动整个半边：L/ZL 与左侧其余部分一起，R/ZR 与右侧一起。此处的内容不会传到游戏中。";
"Draws effects that this device's GPU can't run natively. Experimental, and off by default. Takes effect on the next game launch." = "绘制此设备的 GPU 无法原生运行的效果。实验性功能，默认关闭。在下次启动游戏时生效。";
