"Each game is slow to start once while it rebuilds. Nothing else is lost." = "每款游戏在重建期间会有一次启动较慢。其他内容不会丢失。";
"Each of these games keeps its own value instead of following Settings. Open one to change it or reset it." = "这些游戏各自保留自己的值，而不是跟随“设置”。打开其中一个即可更改或重置。";
