"Error" = "错误";
"Europe" = "欧洲";
"Every button goes back to where Zone puts it, in every game that doesn't have its own layout." = "在所有没有自己布局的游戏中，每个按键都会回到 Zone 的摆放位置。";
"Every button goes back to where Zone puts it, in this game." = "在此游戏中，每个按键都会回到 Zone 的摆放位置。";
"Every control style now uses your calibration. Run it again any time, or reset it from the stick settings." = "现在所有控制样式都使用你的校准。你可以随时再次运行，或在摇杆设置中重置。";
"Every game" = "每款游戏";
"Every group (shoulders, sticks, d-pad, A/B/X/Y, Start, Select, HOME) can be dragged and pinch-resized. Tap the move icon in the top bar during a game.\n\nFit floats the controls over the screen. Native sizes the picture to fit around the controls: small on a phone, life-size on an iPad.\n\nThis pad is experimental." = "每个分组（肩键、摇杆、方向键、A/B/X/Y、Start、Select、HOME）都可以拖移和捏合缩放。在游戏中点按顶栏的移动图标。\n\n“适配”会让控制键浮在画面上。“原生”会调整画面大小以适应控制键：在 iPhone 上较小，在 iPad 上为实际大小。\n\n此按键板为实验性功能。";
"Every group goes back to the preset's own position and size, in every game. The preset, colours and picture mode you picked stay as they are." = "在所有游戏中，每个分组都会回到预设自己的位置和大小。你选取的预设、颜色和画面模式保持不变。";
"Every group goes back to the preset's own positions and sizes. The preset, colours and picture mode you picked are untouched." = "每个分组都会回到预设自己的位置和大小。你选取的预设、颜色和画面模式不受影响。";
"Every menu here starts with \"Same as Settings\", which follows the matching setting in Settings, even if you change it later. Picking anything else sets it for this game only and puts a dot beside it.\n\nScreen layout and Hide on-screen controls when a controller is connected are put in place when the game starts, and your own choices come back when it stops. A layout change you make during the game is not kept.\n\nPerformance overlay On uses the corner chosen in Settings, or the top left if Settings has it off.\n\nChanges apply the next time you start the game." = "这里的每个菜单都以“与设置相同”开头，它会跟随“设置”中的对应设置，即使你之后更改了它。选取其他任何选项，则仅为此游戏设置，并在旁边显示一个圆点。\n\n“屏幕布局”和“连接控制器时隐藏屏幕控制键”会在游戏启动时生效，并在游戏停止时恢复你自己的选择。你在游戏期间所做的布局更改不会保留。\n\n“性能叠加层”设为“开”时，使用“设置”中选定的角落；如果“设置”中为关闭，则使用左上角。\n\n更改会在你下次启动此游戏时生效。";
"Every setting you've changed, and games with settings of their own." = "你更改过的每项设置，以及有自己设置的游戏。";
"Every setting you've changed, wherever it is. Tap one to go to it." = "你更改过的每项设置，无论在哪里。点按一项即可前往。";
"Everything else" = "其他所有内容";
"Everything is at its default." = "一切均为默认值。";
"Everything is shown, including the settings most people never need." = "显示全部内容，包括大多数人用不到的设置。";
"Everything the Menu needs to start is present." = "菜单启动所需的一切均已就绪。";
"Exact title ID" = "精确标题 ID";
"Existing %@ saved as %@." = "现有的 %@ 已存为 %@。";
"Expanded" = "已展开";
"Experimental" = "实验性";
"Experimental. Files must be dumped from your own Wii U. Nothing is included." = "实验性功能。文件必须从你自己的 Wii U 转储。不附带任何文件。";
"Experimental. Replaces the normal pad while on." = "实验性功能。开启时取代普通按键板。";
"Experimental. Sends a Wii U screen to a connected second display." = "实验性功能。将 Wii U 屏幕发送到已连接的第二个显示器。";
"Experimental. The Wii U Menu and its support files must come from your own Wii U, dumped with Dumpling. MuffinEMU includes none of them.\n\nImport Wii U Menu: pick the package folder (the one containing mlc01 and cafeLibs), an mlc01 folder, a sys folder, a cafeLibs folder, or the Menu's own title folder. Files are merged one by one into MuffinEMU's storage; anything replaced is saved first, and your saves are never touched.\n\nImport console files: pick otp.bin and seeprom.bin. Only online features need them; the Menu may start without.\n\nOnce the Menu is installed it appears at the top of the library. Games in your library show up in it. You can show it as a card in the game grid instead, or hide it from the library; hiding doesn't uninstall it.\n\nUninstall Wii U Menu deletes only the Menu itself. Shared data, system apps, cafeLibs, otp.bin and seeprom.bin stay, since games can use them. Your saves and your games are never touched." = "实验性功能。Wii U Menu 及其支持文件必须来自你自己的 Wii U，并用 Dumpling 转储。MuffinEMU 不包含其中任何文件。\n\n导入 Wii U Menu：选取软件包文件夹（包含 mlc01 和 cafeLibs 的那个）、mlc01 文件夹、sys 文件夹、cafeLibs 文件夹，或 Menu 自己的标题文件夹。文件会逐个合并到 MuffinEMU 的存储中；被替换的内容会先保存，你的存档绝不会被动到。\n\n导入主机文件：选取 otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin。只有在线功能需要它们；没有它们 Menu 也可能启动。\n\nMenu 安装后会显示在游戏库顶部。你游戏库中的游戏会显示在其中。你也可以改为在游戏网格中将其显示为卡片，或从游戏库中隐藏；隐藏不会将其卸载。\n\n“卸载 Wii U Menu”只会删除 Menu 本身。共享数据、系统 App、cafeLibs、otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin 会保留，因为游戏可能会用到它们。你的存档和游戏绝不会被动到。";
"Experimental. Turn it on before connecting a second screen." = "实验性功能。请在连接第二块屏幕之前开启。";
"Experimental. Turn it on, then connect a second screen." = "实验性功能。请开启，然后连接第二块屏幕。";
"Experimental: Vulkan runs through MoltenVK on top of Metal. Some games may draw wrongly or stop, and if Vulkan fails the next launch switches back to Metal." = "实验性功能：Vulkan 通过 Metal 之上的 MoltenVK 运行。部分游戏可能绘制错误或停止，如果 Vulkan 失败，下次启动会切回 Metal。";
"Export all settings" = "导出所有设置";
"Export all settings writes one .json file to Files: every setting, and the settings you've set for individual games. It never includes your library, favourites, Wii U keys, accounts, theme or premium unlock.\n\nImport settings reads such a file, checks it, and asks before it replaces anything. Importing replaces all your settings and every game's own options with what the file holds, and anything the file doesn't mention goes back to its default. Some changes apply the next time you start a game." = "“导出所有设置”会将一个 .json 文件写入“文件”：包含每项设置，以及你为个别游戏设置的内容。其中绝不包含你的游戏库、收藏、Wii U 密钥、账户、主题或尊享版解锁。\n\n“导入设置”会读取此类文件、检查它，并在替换任何内容之前询问。导入会用文件中的内容替换你的所有设置和每款游戏自己的选项，文件中没有提到的内容会恢复为默认值。部分更改会在你下次启动游戏时生效。";
"Export cancelled." = "导出已取消。";
"Export colours (.muffinclr)" = "导出颜色（.muffinclr）";
"Export everything" = "导出全部内容";
"Export everything writes one file to Files, in MuffinEMU > Migration. It holds your saves, installed updates and DLC, accounts, keys.txt, otp.bin and seeprom.bin, compiled shader caches, graphic packs, save states, settings, favourites and appearance.\n\nGames (the Roms folder, and base games installed into the Wii U storage) are left out unless you turn on Include games. Without them the export is much smaller, and you can copy your games into the new app in Files. Screen recordings, save backups, logs and other caches are never included. The premium unlock isn't carried over; enter it again in the new app.\n\nThe export runs only while MuffinEMU is open on screen, and keeps the screen awake. You can stop it at any time. Before it starts, MuffinEMU checks that there's enough free space, and the file is kept out of device backups.\n\nWhen it's done, share the file to the new MuffinEMU's Files folder or to another device, install the new MuffinEMU, and choose Import from the old MuffinEMU there. Delete the export afterwards to get the space back." = "“导出全部内容”会将一个文件写入“文件”中的 MuffinEMU > Migration。其中包含你的存档、已安装的更新和 DLC、账户、keys.txt、otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin、已编译的着色器缓存、图形包、即时存档、设置、收藏和外观。\n\n游戏（Roms 文件夹，以及安装到 Wii U 存储中的基础游戏）默认不包含，除非你开启“包含游戏”。不含游戏时导出文件会小得多，你可以在“文件”中将游戏拷贝到新的 App。屏幕录制、存档备份、日志和其他缓存绝不会被包含。尊享版解锁不会一并迁移；请在新的 App 中重新输入。\n\n导出仅在 MuffinEMU 在屏幕上打开时运行，并会保持屏幕常亮。你可以随时停止。开始之前，MuffinEMU 会检查是否有足够的可用空间，并且该文件不会包含在设备备份中。\n\n完成后，请将文件共享到新 MuffinEMU 的“文件”文件夹或另一台设备，安装新的 MuffinEMU，并在其中选取“从旧版 MuffinEMU 导入”。之后请删除导出文件以收回空间。";
