"Learned shaders are what a game has revealed by drawing with them. Importing adds them to this game's own file: anything the game already has stays as it is, and the file is never replaced.\n\nThe file has to be this game's: MuffinEMU checks the version stamp inside it, not the name. Desktop Cemu's files work: learned shaders are named like 000500001010ec00_shaders.bin and are converted the first time the game starts. MuffinEMU's are named ..._mtlshaders.bin. Desktop caches from before Cemu 1.16 use another format and can't be converted.\n\nPipeline caches are named ..._vkpipeline.bin (desktop Cemu, Vulkan) or ..._mtlpipeline.bin (MuffinEMU, Metal). A Vulkan one only helps the Vulkan renderer and a Metal one only the Metal renderer; it's stored either way and used when you switch. Each also needs the game's learned shaders. Import with the game closed. The sizes in Settings update the next time you open it." = "已学习的着色器是游戏在绘制时暴露出来的着色器。导入会将它们添加到此游戏自己的文件中：游戏已有的内容保持不变，文件也绝不会被替换。\n\n文件必须属于此游戏：MuffinEMU 检查的是文件内部的版本标记，而不是名称。桌面版 Cemu 的文件可用：已学习的着色器命名类似 000500001010ec00_shaders.bin，会在游戏首次启动时转换。MuffinEMU 的命名为 ..._mtlshaders.bin。早于 Cemu 1.16 的桌面缓存使用另一种格式，无法转换。\n\n管线缓存命名为 ..._vkpipeline.bin（桌面版 Cemu，Vulkan）或 ..._mtlpipeline.bin（MuffinEMU，Metal）。Vulkan 的只对 Vulkan 渲染器有用，Metal 的只对 Metal 渲染器有用；无论哪种都会存储，并在你切换时使用。每种还需要游戏已学习的着色器。请在游戏关闭时导入。“设置”中的大小会在你下次打开时更新。";
