"MoltenVK is the layer that turns Vulkan into Metal, so it only matters with the Vulkan renderer. 1.4.3 is the default; 1.2.8 is an older build that some games run better on. A change applies the next time MuffinEMU starts." = "MoltenVK 是将 Vulkan 转换为 Metal 的层，因此只与 Vulkan 渲染器有关。1.4.3 是默认版本；1.2.8 是较旧的构建，部分游戏在其上运行得更好。更改会在 MuffinEMU 下次启动时生效。";
