"MuffinEMU can't use your %@'s microphone until you allow it in iOS Settings. Until then, games use the Blow button in the top bar instead." = "在你于 iOS 设置中允许之前，MuffinEMU 无法使用你的%@的麦克风。在此之前，游戏会改用顶栏中的“吹气”按钮。";
"MuffinEMU couldn't decrypt this folder. Its title.tik doesn't unlock the .app files." = "MuffinEMU 无法解密此文件夹。其 title.tik 无法解锁 .app 文件。";
"MuffinEMU couldn't decrypt this game folder. Its title.tik doesn't unlock the .app files - check that title.tmd, title.tik and the .app files are from the same download." = "MuffinEMU 无法解密此游戏文件夹。其 title.tik 无法解锁 .app 文件 - 请检查 title.tmd、title.tik 和 .app 文件是否来自同一次下载。";
