"MuffinEMU couldn't read this game's title ID, so it can't pick out its packs. Browse all packs instead." = "MuffinEMU 无法读取此游戏的标题 ID，因此无法挑出它的包。请改为浏览所有包。";
"MuffinEMU couldn't read this game's title ID, so it doesn't know where its save lives." = "MuffinEMU 无法读取此游戏的标题 ID，因此不知道它的存档在哪里。";
"MuffinEMU couldn't save a copy in Documents/amiibo." = "MuffinEMU 无法在 Documents/amiibo 中保存副本。";
"MuffinEMU downloads GameTDB's Wii U database (about 2 MB), reads it one entry at a time and keeps only your games' entries, so the saved file stays small.\n\nEach game is matched in this order: its exact GameTDB ID worked out from the title ID, then its product code, then its title in any language, always preferring the entry for the game's own region. Every match records how sure it is, and each game's Info screen lets you pick a different entry if one is wrong.\n\nIt also runs by itself in the background for new games. Everything is stored per install, so two copies of one game can match differently." = "MuffinEMU 会下载 GameTDB 的 Wii U 数据库（约 2 MB），逐条读取，只保留你游戏的条目，因此保存的文件很小。\n\n每款游戏按以下顺序匹配：先是根据标题 ID 推算出的精确 GameTDB ID，然后是其产品代码，最后是任意语言的标题，并始终优先选取游戏自身地区的条目。每次匹配都会记录其把握程度，如果某个匹配有误，每款游戏的“信息”屏幕都能让你选取其他条目。\n\n对于新游戏，它还会在后台自动运行。所有内容按每次安装分别存储，因此同一款游戏的两个副本可能匹配出不同结果。";
"MuffinEMU has to be closed and reopened before it can start another game." = "必须先关闭并重新打开 MuffinEMU，才能启动另一款游戏。";
"MuffinEMU is built on Cemu, and its core includes code from MeloCafe by stossy11." = "MuffinEMU 基于 Cemu 构建，其核心包含来自 stossy11 的 MeloCafe 的代码。";
"MuffinEMU is built on Cemu, and its core includes code from MeloCafe by stossy11. The optional Melo-Controller pad is also by stossy11." = "MuffinEMU 基于 Cemu 构建，其核心包含来自 stossy11 的 MeloCafe 的代码。可选的 Melo-Controller 按键板同样出自 stossy11。";
"MuffinEMU is moving to a new app identity, and the new one is a separate app that starts empty. This version stops getting updates after this release. Export your data here, install the new MuffinEMU, then import it there." = "MuffinEMU 正在迁移到新的 App 标识，新的是一个独立的 App，从空白开始。本版本在此次发布后将不再获得更新。请在此导出你的数据，安装新的 MuffinEMU，然后在那里导入。";
