"Override the game's gamma and Override gamma are a separate stage from Display gamma above, not a second copy of it: some games ask for their own gamma value, and this either adds Override gamma on top of that request (off) or replaces the game's request with Override gamma entirely (on) - before Display gamma is applied to the result. Off by default; most games never ask for a specific gamma at all, so this has nothing to override until one does." = "“覆盖游戏的伽马”和“覆盖伽马”与上方的“显示伽马”是不同的阶段，而不是它的第二份副本：有些游戏会要求自己的伽马值，此项要么在该请求之上叠加“覆盖伽马”（关），要么用“覆盖伽马”完全替换游戏的请求（开）——然后才对结果应用“显示伽马”。默认关闭；大多数游戏根本不会要求特定的伽马，所以在有游戏提出要求之前，这里没有可覆盖的内容。";
