"Performance profile" = "性能配置";
"Performance profile picks one trade-off. Balanced is the default.\n\nAccuracy is slower but can fix a game that glitches, desyncs or crashes. It runs on one CPU core and builds every shader before it is needed, whatever Compile shaders in the background is set to.\n\nSpeed is the opposite trade: everything runs as fast as MuffinEMU can make it, and some quality goes. The picture is drawn at Balanced at most with linear scaling, so it's softer. Shaders skip the Wii U's exact multiply rule, which is faster but can make lighting or shadows look wrong in some games. Shaders always compile in the background, so things can pop in for a moment instead of the game pausing. Crash reports carry less detail.\n\nBattery saver runs on one CPU core whatever CPU cores is set to, for less heat and battery use, at some cost in frame rate.\n\nA game can have its own profile in its Game settings.\n\nPause the TV screen and Pause the GamePad screen stop drawing whichever Wii U screen is out of sight while Screen Layout is Single Screen. The game keeps running and the screen picks up again the moment you swap to it. The same two switches are under Display.\n\nCool down automatically acts when iOS reports the device is overheating, and Device heat shows that same state. In Advanced mode, Cool down starts at picks the point: Serious (the default) acts as soon as iOS starts throttling, Critical waits until iOS is throttling hard.\n\nThe profile applies the next time you start a game." = "“性能配置”选择一种取舍。“平衡”是默认值。\n\n“精度”更慢，但可以修复出现画面错误、不同步或崩溃的游戏。它使用一个 CPU 核心，并在需要之前就构建好每个着色器，无论“在后台编译着色器”如何设置。\n\n“速度”是相反的取舍：一切都以 MuffinEMU 能达到的最快速度运行，同时牺牲部分画质。画面最高只以“平衡”并使用线性缩放绘制，因此更模糊。着色器会跳过 Wii U 精确的乘法规则，这样更快，但在某些游戏中可能让光照或阴影看起来不对。着色器始终在后台编译，因此画面元素可能会短暂弹出，而不是让游戏暂停。崩溃报告包含的细节更少。\n\n“省电”无论“CPU 核心”如何设置，都只使用一个 CPU 核心，以减少发热和耗电，但会损失一些帧率。\n\n游戏可以在其“游戏设置”中拥有自己的配置。\n\n当“屏幕布局”为“单屏”时，“电视屏幕不显示时将其暂停”和“GamePad 屏幕不显示时将其暂停”会停止绘制看不到的那块 Wii U 屏幕。游戏继续运行，你一切换过去，该屏幕就会立刻恢复。这两个开关在“显示”下也有。\n\n“自动降温”会在 iOS 报告设备过热时起作用，“设备温度”显示的就是同一状态。在“高级”模式下，“降温开始于”可选择触发点：“严重”（默认）在 iOS 一开始降频时就起作用，“危急”则等到 iOS 大幅降频时才起作用。\n\n此配置会在你下次启动游戏时生效。";
"Persistent ID" = "持久 ID";
"Pick" = "选取";
"Pick a pack folder, a folder that holds several packs, or a zip of either. MuffinEMU checks that it really contains a pack (a rules.txt) before adding it.\n\nImported packs are kept apart from the community download, so updating the community packs never removes them. Importing the same folder name again replaces the earlier copy. To remove an imported pack, open it and choose Remove.\n\nYou can also drop pack folders into graphicPacks inside MuffinEMU's Documents folder in Files." = "选取一个包文件夹、含有多个包的文件夹，或其中任一种的 zip。MuffinEMU 会先检查它确实包含一个包（rules.txt）再添加。\n\n导入的包与社区下载的包分开存放，因此更新社区包绝不会将它们移除。再次导入同名文件夹会替换之前的副本。若要移除导入的包，请打开它并选取“移除”。\n\n你也可以在“文件”中，将包文件夹放入 MuffinEMU 的 Documents 文件夹内的 graphicPacks。";
"Pick an amiibo dump (.bin or .nfc). MuffinEMU keeps a copy in Documents/amiibo so you can scan it again with one tap. The game has to be asking for an amiibo when you scan." = "选取 amiibo 转储文件（.bin 或 .nfc）。MuffinEMU 会在 Documents/amiibo 中保留一份副本，以便你一键再次扫描。扫描时游戏必须正在请求 amiibo。";
"Pick an image from Files, iCloud Drive, or another app." = "从“文件”、iCloud 云盘或其他 App 中选取图像。";
"Pick the .muffinmove file you exported from the old MuffinEMU. It can be on this device or in iCloud Drive. This also works to restore your data after reinstalling MuffinEMU.\n\nMuffinEMU checks the file first and shows what it would change. Files that aren't here yet are added, and files that are older than the export's are updated. If a file here is newer than the export's copy, you choose whether to keep it or replace it; saves that are replaced are moved to save-backups first, not deleted. Every file is checked as it is copied, so a damaged export can't leave a half-written file behind, and an interrupted import can simply be run again.\n\nIt works only while MuffinEMU is open on screen. When it finishes, close MuffinEMU and open it again." = "选取你从旧版 MuffinEMU 导出的 .muffinmove 文件。它可以在此设备上，也可以在 iCloud 云盘中。重新安装 MuffinEMU 后，也可以用它来恢复你的数据。\n\nMuffinEMU 会先检查该文件，并显示它将更改的内容。此处尚不存在的文件会被添加，比导出文件旧的文件会被更新。如果此处的文件比导出文件中的副本新，你可以选择保留还是替换；被替换的存档会先移到 save-backups，而不是被删除。每个文件在拷贝时都会校验，因此损坏的导出文件不会留下写了一半的文件，被中断的导入也可以直接再运行一次。\n\n仅在 MuffinEMU 在屏幕上打开时有效。完成后，请关闭 MuffinEMU 并重新打开。";
