"Position picks a corner of the TV screen; Off hides every pop-up, and the other rows stay dimmed until a corner is chosen.\n\nController profiles: your account name and each controller's saved profile, for a few seconds after a game starts. Low controller battery: a paired controller is running down. Shader compiling: shown while the engine builds new shaders. Friends: friend activity from your account." = "“位置”选择电视屏幕的一个角落；“关”会隐藏所有弹出通知，在选取角落之前，其他行会保持变暗。\n\n控制器配置：游戏开始后几秒内显示你的账户名称和每个控制器已保存的配置。控制器电量低：已配对的控制器电量即将耗尽。着色器编译：引擎构建新着色器时显示。好友：来自你账户的好友动态。";
