"Some games (Skylanders, Disney Infinity, LEGO Dimensions) read toy figures from a USB portal, base or toypad. Turn on the one your game uses; it applies the next time you start a game.\n\nManage Figures lets you load a figure dump you own, create a new save for a figure, or clear a slot. No figure data is included with MuffinEMU." = "部分游戏（Skylanders、Disney Infinity、LEGO Dimensions）会从 USB 底座、基座或 Toypad 读取玩具角色。请开启你的游戏所用的那一个；它会在你下次启动游戏时生效。\n\n“管理角色”可让你载入你自己拥有的角色转储、为角色创建新存档，或清除某个插槽。MuffinEMU 不附带任何角色数据。";
