"TV and GamePad audio are separate tracks with their own on/off, volume and channel layout.\n\nChannels: Mono mixes everything to one channel, Stereo splits left and right (default), Surround asks the game for more channels; most games only use stereo. Turning TV or GamePad audio on or off, and changing channels, applies the next time you start a game.\n\nGamePad audio plays whatever the game sends to the GamePad speaker. Many games send nothing different from the TV mix.\n\nUse microphone feeds your device's real microphone to games that ask for the GamePad mic, while the game has the mic open. iOS asks for permission the first time you turn it on; if you say no, it switches back off. While it's on, the in-game Blow button is hidden. When it's off, games still see a GamePad mic, but it only hears the Blow button (a simulated puff of air) and iOS never asks for permission. Microphone volume (50 is normal, 100 is twice as loud) applies the next time a game opens the mic." = "电视和 GamePad 音频是独立的音轨，各自有开关、音量和声道布局。\n\n声道：“单声道”将所有声音混合为一个声道，“立体声”分为左右声道（默认），“环绕声”向游戏请求更多声道；大多数游戏只使用立体声。开启或关闭电视或 GamePad 音频，以及更改声道，会在你下次启动游戏时生效。\n\nGamePad 音频播放游戏发送到 GamePad 扬声器的任何内容。许多游戏发送的内容与电视混音并无不同。\n\n“使用麦克风”会在游戏打开麦克风期间，将你设备的真实麦克风送给请求 GamePad 麦克风的游戏。你首次开启时，iOS 会请求权限；如果你拒绝，它会切换回关闭。开启时，游戏内的“吹气”按钮会被隐藏。关闭时，游戏仍能看到 GamePad 麦克风，但它只能听到“吹气”按钮（模拟的一口气），iOS 也绝不会请求权限。“麦克风音量”（50 为正常，100 为两倍响）会在游戏下次打开麦克风时生效。";
"TV and GamePad audio have their own volume and channel layout. GamePad audio plays through this device's speaker or headphones. Use the microphone to give games your real voice and sounds through the GamePad mic; otherwise the in-game Blow button covers games that ask you to blow." = "电视和 GamePad 音频有各自的音量和声道布局。GamePad 音频通过此设备的扬声器或耳机播放。使用麦克风，可通过 GamePad 麦克风将你的真实声音和声响传给游戏；否则，游戏内的“吹气”按钮可应对要求你吹气的游戏。";
