"Tap a button to pick it, then drag it to move it, pinch it or use Size to resize it. It stops where it would touch another button or leave the screen." = "点按一个按键来选取它，然后拖移来移动，捏合或使用“大小”来调整大小。它会在即将碰到其他按键或离开屏幕处停下。";
"Tap a button to pick its whole group (the d-pad, the face buttons, a stick, a pair of shoulder buttons, or plus, minus and HOME), then drag or pinch it as one." = "点按一个按键来选取其整个分组（方向键、面键、一个摇杆、一对肩键，或加号、减号和 HOME），然后将其作为一个整体拖移或捏合。";
