"That folder doesn't look like a Wii U save. Pick the folder named after the game's title ID, or the 'user' folder inside it." = "该文件夹看起来不是 Wii U 存档。请选取以游戏标题 ID 命名的文件夹，或其中的“user”文件夹。";
