"That isn't a usable network_services.xml. It needs a <content> element with a <urls> list of web addresses." = "这不是可用的 network_services.xml。它需要一个 <content> 元素，其中含有网址的 <urls> 列表。";
"That link isn't valid." = "该链接无效。";
