"That title folder isn't a Wii U Menu (title id %@). The Menu is 0005001010040000, 0005001010040100 or 0005001010040200." = "该标题文件夹不是 Wii U Menu（标题 ID %@）。Menu 的标题 ID 是 0005001010040000、0005001010040100 或 0005001010040200。";
"The %@ link isn't valid. Check it in Settings, under JIT enabler." = "%@ 链接无效。请在“设置”的“JIT 启用工具”下检查。";
"The .wua doesn't contain a matching update or DLC for this game." = "该 .wua 中没有与此游戏匹配的更新或 DLC。";
"The .wua file couldn't be read. It may be corrupted." = "无法读取该 .wua 文件。它可能已损坏。";
"The 3D box template behind MuffinEMU's no-cover images." = "MuffinEMU 无封面图像背后的 3D 盒装模板。";
"The Accuracy profile runs this game on one core whatever this says." = "无论此处如何设置，“精度”配置都会让此游戏只使用一个核心。";
"The Battery saver profile runs this game on one core whatever this says." = "无论此处如何设置，“省电”配置都会让此游戏只使用一个核心。";
"The CPU line shows what this launch got: the recompiler (JIT), which is the fast way, or the interpreter, which is much slower. The recompiler needs a JIT enabler (StikJIT, SideStore or LiveContainer); both are set under JIT.\n\nCPU cores (Advanced mode) picks how many cores run a game. Auto decides for each game and device. The Accuracy and Battery saver performance profiles run on one core whatever this says.\n\nMemory shows how much the recompiler reserved. If it couldn't reserve any, the interpreter runs instead.\n\nCPU cores applies the next time you start a game." = "CPU 行显示此次启动使用的方式：重编译器 (JIT)，即快速方式，或解释器，慢得多。重编译器需要 JIT 启用工具（StikJIT、SideStore 或 LiveContainer）；两者都在“JIT”下设置。\n\n“CPU 核心”（高级模式）选择运行游戏的核心数量。“自动”会针对每款游戏和每台设备自行决定。无论此处如何设置，“精度”和“省电”性能配置都只使用一个核心。\n\n“内存”显示重编译器预留了多少。如果无法预留，则改为运行解释器。\n\n“CPU 核心”会在你下次启动游戏时生效。";
"The FPS and usage readout over the game: what it lists, and where." = "游戏上方的 FPS 和占用读数：列出什么，以及显示在哪里。";
"The GamePad at its real size and proportions, clean and sleek. Native keeps the picture clear; Fit wraps the pad around it." = "GamePad 以真实大小和比例呈现，简洁流畅。“原生”保持画面清晰；“适配”则让按键板环绕画面。";
"The GamePad has no button bindings, so presses go nowhere while sticks still work. Settings > On-screen Controls > Reset controller bindings." = "GamePad 没有按键绑定，因此按下的按键没有去处，而摇杆仍然正常。请前往“设置”>“屏幕控制”>“重置控制器绑定”。";
"The GamePad layout, but each group of buttons slowly moves to where your thumbs actually press." = "GamePad 布局，但每组按键会慢慢移动到你拇指实际按压的位置。";
"The GamePad's own layout with forgiving, gap-free touch zones, slide between buttons and two-button presses." = "GamePad 自己的布局，带有宽容、无间隙的触控区域，支持在按键间滑动和双键同按。";
"The GameTDB database couldn't be read." = "无法读取 GameTDB 数据库。";
