"The polished look on every control style: hairline outlines, soft shadows, a lit rim and buttons that sink when pressed. Off keeps the flat look." = "所有控制样式上的精致外观：细线轮廓、柔和阴影、发光边缘，以及按下时下沉的按键。关闭则保持扁平外观。";
