"The slowest setting. If a game still won't move, the clock isn't the problem." = "最慢的设置。如果游戏仍然不动，问题就不在时钟上。";
"The stick's centre is wherever your thumb lands in its zone, so the first touch is never a push." = "摇杆的中心是你拇指在其区域内落下的任何位置，因此第一次触碰绝不会算作推动。";
"The title list comes from GameTDB's database. Scrape once to download it." = "标题列表来自 GameTDB 的数据库。抓取一次即可下载。";
"The top bar, and when the controls hide or pause the game." = "顶栏，以及控制键何时隐藏或暂停游戏。";
