"The zip is damaged (%@)." = "该 zip 已损坏（%@）。";
"The zip is larger than graphic packs should be." = "该 zip 比图形包应有的大小更大。";
"The zip uses a feature MuffinEMU can't read (%@)." = "该 zip 使用了 MuffinEMU 无法读取的功能（%@）。";
"Theme" = "主题";
"Theme music" = "主题音乐";
