"Theme, app icon, Flat surfaces and Classic UI." = "主题、App 图标、扁平表面和经典界面。";
"There are no shader files for this game yet. Play it first." = "此游戏还没有着色器文件。请先游玩。";
"There is no game data for this install yet. Scrape it from Settings > Cover + data scraping, or here." = "此安装还没有游戏数据。请在“设置”>“封面和数据抓取”或此处进行抓取。";
"There's no VSync switch because iOS always syncs frames to the screen's own refresh, so the picture never tears and there is nothing to turn off. For even frame pacing, use Steady frame rate at the top of Graphics." = "没有垂直同步开关，因为 iOS 始终会将帧与屏幕自身的刷新同步，所以画面绝不会撕裂，也没有什么可以关闭的。若要获得均匀的帧节奏，请使用“图形”顶部的“稳定帧率”。";
"There's no save for this game yet. Play it once, then export." = "此游戏还没有存档。请先游玩一次，然后再导出。";
"These act when Screen Layout is Single Screen (Screen and sound > Display). Your layout shows both screens, so nothing is paused now." = "这些在“屏幕布局”为“单屏”时起作用（“屏幕和声音”>“显示”）。你的布局显示两块屏幕，因此现在没有任何内容被暂停。";
"These are independent projects, listed for information. MuffinEMU doesn't host them, and there's no server address built in for them: import the network_services.xml their host gives you.\n\nPretendo Network is built in under Network Service, but it needs a Wii U's account and console files." = "这些是独立的项目，仅供参考。MuffinEMU 不托管它们，也没有为它们内置服务器地址：请导入其主机给你的 network_services.xml。\n\nPretendo Network 内置在“网络服务”下，但它需要 Wii U 的账户和主机文件。";
"These settings apply to every game, except that Adaptive remembers where your thumbs land separately for each game." = "这些设置适用于所有游戏，不过“自适应”会按游戏分别记住你拇指落下的位置。";
"These settings apply to every game." = "这些设置适用于所有游戏。";
"These styles don't support dragging individual buttons. " = "这些样式不支持单独拖移按键。";
"This .wua holds more than the one update or DLC for this game. Use a .wua with just that content." = "此 .wua 包含的内容不止此游戏的一个更新或 DLC。请使用只包含该内容的 .wua。";
"This Device" = "此设备";
"This account has no cached NNID/PNID login, so it can't play online yet." = "此账户没有已缓存的 NNID/PNID 登录信息，因此暂时无法在线游玩。";
"This app" = "此 App";
"This clears every game's shaders. Games will stutter while they rebuild them." = "这会清除所有游戏的着色器。游戏在重建它们期间会卡顿。";
"This comes from the graphics chip, memory and screen, not a speed test, so treat it as a starting point." = "这来自图形芯片、内存和屏幕，而不是速度测试，因此请将其视为起点。";
"This content is for a different game or region than the one you picked." = "此内容属于与你所选不同的游戏或地区。";
"This deletes \"%@\" from MuffinEMU to free up space. Your saves and options are kept. To play it again, add the game back." = "这会从 MuffinEMU 中删除“%@”以释放空间。你的存档和选项会保留。若要再次游玩，请重新添加该游戏。";
"This deletes the Wii U Menu from MuffinEMU's storage. Shared data, system apps, cafeLibs, otp.bin and seeprom.bin stay, since games can use them. Your saves and your games aren't touched. You can import the Menu again from Settings > Wii U Menu." = "这会从 MuffinEMU 的存储中删除 Wii U Menu。共享数据、系统 App、cafeLibs、otp.bin 和 seeprom.bin 会保留，因为游戏可能会用到它们。你的存档和游戏不会被动到。你可以在“设置”>“Wii U Menu”中再次导入 Menu。";
"This device" = "此设备";
"This device doesn't support mesh shaders, so graphic packs that rely on geometry shaders or post-processing (RECTS) draws may not render correctly. Everything else works normally." = "此设备不支持网格着色器，因此依赖几何着色器或后期处理 (RECTS) 绘制的图形包可能无法正确渲染。其他一切正常。";
"This device doesn't support mesh shaders, so some graphic packs may not render correctly. See Graphic Packs below." = "此设备不支持网格着色器，因此部分图形包可能无法正确渲染。请参阅下方的“图形包”。";
"This device has no motion sensors, so the GamePad will stay still." = "此设备没有体感传感器，因此 GamePad 将保持不动。";
"This device's own layout." = "此设备自己的布局。";
"This device's report for bug reports, and diagnostics." = "此设备的报告，用于错误报告和诊断。";
"This encrypted folder is missing one or more .app files listed in its title.tmd." = "此加密文件夹缺少其 title.tmd 中列出的一个或多个 .app 文件。";
"This encrypted folder's title.tik couldn't be read." = "无法读取此加密文件夹的 title.tik。";
"This encrypted folder's title.tmd couldn't be read." = "无法读取此加密文件夹的 title.tmd。";
"This file has %d settings and %@. Importing replaces all of your settings and every game's own options. Your library, keys, accounts and premium unlock are not touched." = "此文件包含 %d 项设置和 %@。导入会替换你的所有设置和每款游戏自己的选项。你的游戏库、密钥、账户和尊享版解锁不会被动到。";
"This file is encrypted and no matching key is installed. Add your keys.txt in Settings first." = "此文件已加密，且没有安装匹配的密钥。请先在“设置”中添加你的 keys.txt。";
"This folder is missing title.tik (the ticket), which MuffinEMU needs to decrypt it." = "此文件夹缺少 title.tik（票据），MuffinEMU 需要它来解密。";
"This game didn't start. Try again. If it keeps happening, close and reopen MuffinEMU." = "此游戏没有启动。请再试一次。如果一再发生，请关闭并重新打开 MuffinEMU。";
"This game folder is missing a readable title.tmd or title.tik, which MuffinEMU needs to decrypt it." = "此游戏文件夹缺少可读取的 title.tmd 或 title.tik，MuffinEMU 需要它们来解密。";
"This game folder is missing one or more .app files listed in its title.tmd." = "此游戏文件夹缺少其 title.tmd 中列出的一个或多个 .app 文件。";
"This game is encrypted, so it needs a keys.txt file to start." = "此游戏已加密，因此需要 keys.txt 文件才能启动。";
"This game's own cache file couldn't be opened or created, so nothing was changed. If storage is full, free some up and try again." = "无法打开或创建此游戏自己的缓存文件，因此未做任何更改。如果存储空间已满，请先释放一些空间，然后再试一次。";
"This game's own cache file was saved by a different version of the cache format, so nothing was changed. Clear this game's shaders on its page in the library, then import again." = "此游戏自己的缓存文件由不同版本的缓存格式存储，因此未做任何更改。请在游戏库中此游戏的页面上清除其着色器，然后再次导入。";
"This game's shaders are listed once the game has been identified. Start it once." = "识别出游戏后，才会列出其着色器。请启动一次。";
"This install" = "此安装";
"This is %@, not %@. Use the other import option." = "这是 %@，不是 %@。请使用另一个导入选项。";
"This is a %@ pipeline cache and the renderer is set to %@, so it won't be used until you switch in Settings > Graphics. It's saved under its own name and will be picked up then." = "这是 %@ 管线缓存，而渲染器设置为 %@，因此在你于“设置”>“图形”中切换之前不会被使用。它会以自己的名称存储，到时会被拾取。";
"This is the experimental pad. Its size, colours and layout presets are in Settings." = "这是实验性按键板。其大小、颜色和布局预设在“设置”中。";
"This is the save the game itself writes. It uses the Wii U's own format, so it can move between MuffinEMU, desktop Cemu and a real console. A save state is a snapshot of the whole emulated console and only MuffinEMU can read it.\n\nExport writes a folder named after the game and title ID. Import accepts that folder, a folder named after the title ID from another Cemu install, or its 'user' folder. Importing replaces the current save; the old one is first copied to save-backups in MuffinEMU's Documents folder." = "这是游戏自己写入的存档。它使用 Wii U 自己的格式，因此可以在 MuffinEMU、桌面版 Cemu 和真实主机之间移动。即时存档是整个模拟主机的快照，只有 MuffinEMU 能读取。\n\n“导出”会写出一个以游戏名称和标题 ID 命名的文件夹。“导入”接受该文件夹、另一个 Cemu 安装中以标题 ID 命名的文件夹，或其“user”文件夹。导入会替换当前存档；旧存档会先被拷贝到 MuffinEMU 的 Documents 文件夹中的 save-backups。";
"This isn't a Wii U DLC or update file." = "这不是 Wii U 的 DLC 或更新文件。";
"This isn't a Wii U game file MuffinEMU can read. It accepts .wua, .wux, .wud, .iso, .rpx, .elf and .wuhb files, or a game folder. Encrypted games also need keys.txt." = "这不是 MuffinEMU 可读取的 Wii U 游戏文件。支持 .wua、.wux、.wud、.iso、.rpx、.elf 和 .wuhb 文件，或游戏文件夹。加密游戏还需要 keys.txt。";
"This pack won't activate" = "此包不会激活";
"This replaces %@'s current save. The one you have now is backed up first, and the game should be closed before you do this." = "这会替换 %@ 的当前存档。你现有的存档会先备份，并且在此之前应关闭游戏。";
"Three cores (Experimental)" = "三核心（实验性）";
"Three cores. Can be faster on a device with spare performance cores and cooling, but heats up quickly on most iPads and has hung some games." = "三个核心。在有多余性能核心和散热的设备上可能更快，但在大多数 iPad 上会很快发热，并且曾导致部分游戏卡死。";
