"Unpacking" = "正在解压";
"Until you choose a value, MuffinEMU picks one itself: if a game hasn't started drawing after 12 seconds, it slows its clock a step (down to 1/64). Choosing a value here turns that off.\n\nWithout the recompiler the emulated CPU is much slower than the console's, so games can fall behind their own timers and never draw a frame. Slowing the game's clock gives them room. Emulation accuracy isn't affected." = "在你选取值之前，MuffinEMU 会自行选取：如果游戏在 12 秒后仍未开始绘制，它会将时钟降低一档（最低 1/64）。在此选取一个值会关闭该行为。\n\n没有重编译器时，模拟的 CPU 比主机的慢得多，因此游戏可能跟不上自己的计时器，永远画不出一帧。减慢游戏的时钟可以给它们留出余地。模拟精度不受影响。";
